### ============================================================
### 📝 SUPPLIER NOTES (Notas de Trato)
### ============================================================

### Obtener todas las notas
### Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filtrar notas por status
### Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear una nota de trato
### Esperado: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "total_amount": 500.00,
  "delivery_date": "2026-08-15",
  "reminders": "Llamar antes de entregar",
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": 6,
      "quantity_agreed": 10,
      "price_agreed": 12.50,
      "discount": 0,
      "is_gift": false
    }
  ]
}

### Ver una nota (usa un ID real)
### Esperado: 200 + note con supplier, details, createdBy, confirmedBy
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar una nota pendiente
### Esperado: 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "total_amount": 500.00,
  "delivery_date": "2026-08-15",
  "reminders": "Actualizado"
}

### Intentar editar una nota CONFIRMADA (debe rechazar)
### Esperado: 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "total_amount": 999.00,
  "delivery_date": "2026-08-20",
  "reminders": "Intento de bypass"
}

### Confirmar nota — actualiza stock
### Esperado: 200 + diferencias
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/2/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity_received": 10 }
  ]
}

### Confirmar nota con observaciones (cantidades diferentes)
### Esperado: 200 + diferencias
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/8/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity_received": 8 }
  ],
  "observations": "El proveedor solo trajo 8 de los 10 acordados"
}

### Intentar confirmar con productos DUPLICADOS (debe rechazar)
### Esperado: 422
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/6/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity_received": 5 },
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity_received": 3 }
  ]
}

### Registrar pago de nota confirmada
### Esperado: 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/3/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Ver historial de notas confirmadas/pagadas
### Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Eliminar una nota
### Esperado: 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


