### ============================================================
### 🧾 SALES
### ============================================================

### 0. Verificar turno activo antes de vender
### Si no hay turno, debe retornar 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 0.1 Abrir turno (solo si no hay uno activo)
### Esperado: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "opening_cash": 500.00
}

### Obtener todas las ventas
### Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1. Crear venta — UN solo producto, pago 100% efectivo
### Esperado: 201 + sale_group_id + change_amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 11, "quantity": 2, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "cash",
  "cash_amount": 98.00,
  "card_amount": 0
}

### 2. Crear venta — VARIOS productos, pago 100% tarjeta
### Esperado: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" },
    { "product_id": 12, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "card",
  "cash_amount": 0,
  "card_amount": 90.00
}

### 3. Crear venta — VARIOS productos, pago MIXTO (efectivo + tarjeta)
### Esperado: 201 + sale_group_id para usar en cancelar grupo
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" },
    { "product_id": 12, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "mixed",
  "cash_amount": 40.00,
  "card_amount": 24.00
}

### 4. Pago insuficiente — debe rechazar
### Esperado: 422 "El monto pagado no cubre el total"
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 5, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "cash",
  "cash_amount": 5.00,
  "card_amount": 0
}

### 5. Stock insuficiente — debe rechazar
### Esperado: 400 "No hay suficiente stock"
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 9999, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "cash",
  "cash_amount": 999999,
  "card_amount": 0
}

### Ver una venta por ID (usa un ID real de los pasos 1-3)
### Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Actualizar venta — cambiar a producto MAS BARATO (genera cambio)
### Esperado: 200 + cambio_a_entregar > 0
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales/21
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_id": 10,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 7. Actualizar venta — producto MAS CARO sin pagar diferencia (debe rechazar)
### Esperado: 422 "Faltan $X por cobrar"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales/25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_id": 20,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 8. Actualizar venta — producto MAS CARO, cubriendo la diferencia
### Esperado: 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales/25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_id": 13,
  "quantity": 2,
  "additional_cash": 20.00,
  "additional_card": 50.00
}

### 9. Cancelar UNA sola linea de venta
### Esperado: 200 + stock devuelto
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/17/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Intentar cancelar la misma linea OTRA VEZ (debe rechazar)
### Esperado: 400 "ya esta cancelada"
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/17/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Revertir cancelacion (solo Administrador)
### Esperado: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/25/revert
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Cancelar TICKET COMPLETO (usa sale_group_id real del paso 3)
### Copia el sale_group_id que te devolvio el paso 3
### Esperado: 200 + lineas_canceladas
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/group/91f99b7e-9038-4ce8-82b5-033be9a1a701/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Intentar cancelar el mismo grupo OTRA VEZ (reporta lineas ya canceladas)
### Esperado: 200 + lineas_ya_canceladas_previamente
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/group/91f99b7e-9038-4ce8-82b5-033be9a1a701/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Eliminar una venta — si estaba cancelada NO debe duplicar stock
### Esperado: 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sales/17
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### 💵 CASH REGISTERS (Corte de Caja)
### ============================================================

### Obtener todos los cortes de caja
### Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver turno activo
### Si no hay turno abierto: 404
### Si hay turno: 200 + data con el turno
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Abrir turno
### Esperado: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "opening_cash": 500.00
}

### Intentar abrir OTRO turno sin cerrar el primero (debe rechazar)
### Esperado: 400 "Ya tienes un turno abierto"
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "opening_cash": 500.00
}

### Ver un corte de caja especifico
### Esperado: 200 + data con sales
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cerrar turno
### Revisa que total_efectivo_ventas y total_tarjeta_ventas
### coincidan con la suma de las ventas que hiciste
### Esperado: 200 + total_efectivo_ventas + total_tarjeta_ventas + diferencia
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "closed_cash": 850.00
}


### ============================================================
### 🏦 PROVIDER FUNDS (Fondo de Proveedores)
### ============================================================

### Ver fondo de proveedores + notas pendientes
### Esperado: 200 + data + suppliers_pending + supplier_notes_pending
GET {{baseUrl}}/provider-funds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver un fondo especifico
### Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/provider-funds/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar el fondo
### Esperado: 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/provider-funds/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "defined_amount": 5000.00,
  "extraction_limit": 2000.00,
  "available_balance": 5000.00
}

### Extraer del fondo (registrar pago a proveedor)
### Esperado: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/provider-funds/1/extract
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000.00
}

### Intentar extraer MAS que el saldo disponible (debe rechazar)
### Esperado: 400 "excede el saldo disponible"
POST {{baseUrl}}/provider-funds/1/extract
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 999999.00
}


### ============================================================
### 📈 DASHBOARD
### ============================================================

### Dashboard general
### Esperado: 200 + ventasHoy, ventasHoyTotal, productosConBajoStock, etc.
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reporte de ventas
### Esperado: 200 + data paginado
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/reportes/ventas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reporte de productos
### Esperado: 200 + data
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/reportes/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reporte de clientes
### Esperado: 200 + data con debts
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/reportes/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reporte de deudas
### Esperado: 200 + data
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/reportes/deudas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Descargar reporte PDF
### Esperado: 200 + archivo PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/reportes/dashboard/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Descargar reporte CSV
### Esperado: 200 + archivo CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/reportes/dashboard/csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 🧪 PRUEBAS DE FLUJO COMPLETO
### ============================================================

### Flujo: Abrir turno -> Vender -> Cerrar turno -> Verificar diferencias
### Paso 1: Abrir turno
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "opening_cash": 500.00
}

### Paso 2: Vender — Pan Integral x2 = $96, paga $98 en efectivo
### Esperado: 201 + change_amount = 2.00
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 11, "quantity": 2, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "cash",
  "cash_amount": 98.00,
  "card_amount": 0
}

### Paso 3: Ticket de 2 productos, pago mixto con cambio
### Esperado: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" },
    { "product_id": 12, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "mixed",
  "cash_amount": 30.00,
  "card_amount": 30.00
}

### Paso 4: Cerrar turno
### Revisa que los totales coincidan con lo vendido
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "closed_cash": 850.00
}


### ============================================================
### 🔄 FLUJO: NOTA DE PROVEEDOR -> CONFIRMAR -> STOCK ACTUALIZADO
### ============================================================

### Paso 1: Crear nota de trato
POST {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "total_amount": 500.00,
  "delivery_date": "2026-08-15",
  "reminders": "Llamar antes de entregar",
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": 6,
      "quantity_agreed": 10,
      "price_agreed": 12.50,
      "discount": 0,
      "is_gift": false
    }
  ]
}

### Paso 2: Confirmar con cantidades reales (menos de lo acordado)
### Stock del producto 6 debe incrementarse en 8
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/2/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity_received": 8 }
  ],
  "observations": "El proveedor solo trajo 8 de los 10 acordados"
}

### Paso 3: Verificar historial
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### 🔗 FLUJO: PRODUCTOS CON CODIGOS DE PROVEEDOR
### ============================================================

### Paso 1: Registrar codigo "5000" para Frijol del proveedor 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-supplier-codes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 7,
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "code": "5000"
}

### Paso 2: Registrar ESE MISMO codigo "5000" para Coca Cola del proveedor 7
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-supplier-codes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 12,
  "supplier_id": 7,
  "code": "5000"
}

### Paso 3: Ticket proveedor 1 con codigo "5000" -> debe dar Frijol (id: 7)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/match
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "products": [
    { "nombre": "FRIJOL", "codigo": "5000", "cantidad": 5, "precio_unitario": 26 }
  ]
}

### Paso 4: Ticket proveedor 7 con codigo "5000" -> debe dar Coca Cola (id: 12)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/match
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 7,
  "products": [
    { "nombre": "COCA", "codigo": "5000", "cantidad": 5, "precio_unitario": 38 }
  ]
}
